{"seq":2,"slug":"iot-open-door-command-protocol","title":"IoT 联通与开柜指令协议设计（幂等、鉴权、时延）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-parcel-locker-pudo-network/locker-hardware-iot-integration/iot-open-door-command-protocol","wordCount":2716,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"iot-联通与开柜指令协议设计-幂等-鉴权-时延\">IoT 联通与开柜指令协议设计（幂等、鉴权、时延）</h1><p>用户在 App 上点「取件」的那一刻，系统发出的不是一条 HTTP 请求，而是一个<strong>跨越公网、蜂窝网、柜机主控、RS-485 总线、到最后一道电磁锁</strong>的分布式事务。这条链路上任何一环重试、丢包或超时，都可能让用户看到「开柜失败」却已经被计费，或者让一个格口被连开两次。把开柜指令做成可运营的工程对象，要同时解决三件事：<strong>幂等</strong>（同一意图重复到达只产生一次物理动作）、<strong>鉴权</strong>（谁有权要求这台柜子打开哪一个格口）、<strong>时延预算</strong>（从点击到门弹开在用户可以容忍的秒数内完成）。本文拆解这条链路的协议分层、幂等原语、信任链与降级路径，硬件侧的分层与锁控板模型见同 hub 的 <a href=\"locker-hardware-compartment-model\">柜机硬件架构与格口规格建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-开柜是一条有状态的指令通道\">核心概念：开柜是一条有状态的指令通道</h2><p>把开柜当成一次无状态的 RPC 是这类系统最典型的架构缺陷。真实柜机的开柜是一次<strong>至少一次投递 + 一次物理执行</strong>的语义错配：网络层天然会重试，而锁只会被打开一次。工程上必须在协议里显式区分四类事件——<strong>指令下发（command）</strong>、<strong>设备执行（actuation）</strong>、<strong>设备回执（ack）</strong>、<strong>业务确认（confirm）</strong>——并且让前三者与「用户是否真的取走了包裹」解耦。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    U[用户 App 点击取件] --&gt; API[业务 API&lt;br/&gt;生成 open_request]&#10;    API --&gt; MQ[消息总线 MQTT&lt;br/&gt;QoS1 至少一次]&#10;    MQ --&gt; GW[边缘网关 / 柜机主控]&#10;    GW --&gt; BUS[RS-485 锁控总线]&#10;    BUS --&gt; LOCK[电磁锁执行]&#10;    LOCK --&gt; ACK[门磁反馈回执]&#10;    ACK --&gt; EVT[事件流 + 对账]&#10;    EVT --&gt; API&#10;    API --&gt; U2[App 显示开柜结果]\">graph TD\n    U[用户 App 点击取件] --&gt; API[业务 API&lt;br/&gt;生成 open_request]\n    API --&gt; MQ[消息总线 MQTT&lt;br/&gt;QoS1 至少一次]\n    MQ --&gt; GW[边缘网关 / 柜机主控]\n    GW --&gt; BUS[RS-485 锁控总线]\n    BUS --&gt; LOCK[电磁锁执行]\n    LOCK --&gt; ACK[门磁反馈回执]\n    ACK --&gt; EVT[事件流 + 对账]\n    EVT --&gt; API\n    API --&gt; U2[App 显示开柜结果]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语义层</th>\n<th>传输保障</th>\n<th>可能失败态</th>\n<th>幂等责任方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指令下发</td>\n<td>MQTT QoS1 / HTTPS</td>\n<td>重复下发、丢失</td>\n<td>云端（请求 ID 去重）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总线执行</td>\n<td>RS-485 主从轮询</td>\n<td>总线冲突、地址漂移</td>\n<td>主控（指令序号）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锁动作</td>\n<td>电气脉冲</td>\n<td>卡锁、掉电解锁</td>\n<td>锁控板（本地状态机）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回执上行</td>\n<td>门磁 + 事件</td>\n<td>回执丢失、延迟</td>\n<td>云端（对账补偿）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>行业里已有成熟的类比：充电桩领域用 <strong>Open Charge Point Protocol（OCPP）2.0.1</strong>（Open Charge Alliance 发布）定义了「远程启停」这类现场设备指令的幂等标识与状态机，柜机开柜协议在结构上与之同源——一个由云端生成、全局唯一、设备侧可去重的<strong>指令标识</strong>，是整条链路的锚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等设计-请求-id-去重窗口与格口状态机\">幂等设计：请求 ID、去重窗口与格口状态机</h2><p>幂等的第一性原理是：<strong>同一逻辑意图只能映射到一个物理动作</strong>。做法是在链路入口生成一个不可复用的 <code>open_request_id</code>（UUIDv7 或 ULID，含时间前缀便于窗口裁剪），并让它在每一跳都被携带与记录。</p>\n<p>网络重试的间隔服从指数退避。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的等待时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则常见实现为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>jitter</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min\\left(t_0 \\cdot 2^{n}, t_{\\max}\\right) + \\mathcal{U}(0, \\text{jitter})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jitter</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常取 0.5–1 s，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取 10–30 s，抖动项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>jitter</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{U}(0,\\text{jitter})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jitter</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 防止大量柜机在同一时刻雪崩重连。去重窗口必须覆盖整条重试链的总时长：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试、单次超时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则服务端去重记录的存活时间</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>dedup</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{dedup}} \\ge \\sum_{n=1}^{N} t_n + N \\cdot T_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dedup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程经验值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>dedup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{dedup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dedup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取 5–15 分钟，远比一个 HTTP 请求的寿命长——因为柜机可能离线数分钟后再上线补发回执。</p>\n<p>去重键之外，格口本身要有<strong>状态机</strong>兜底。一个格口在同一时刻只允许一个「进行中」的开柜意图，非法转移必须被拒绝而非静默接受：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>当前状态</th>\n<th>收到 new_req</th>\n<th>收到 dup_req（同 request_id）</th>\n<th>收到 dup_req（不同 id，同格口）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IDLE</td>\n<td>→ OPENING，执行</td>\n<td>返回进行中，不重复执行</td>\n<td>拒绝（占用冲突）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OPENING</td>\n<td>排队 / 拒绝</td>\n<td>返回进行中</td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OPEN</td>\n<td>允许（新用户）</td>\n<td>返回缓存结果</td>\n<td>拒绝（仍占用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FAULT</td>\n<td>转人工</td>\n<td>返回故障</td>\n<td>返回故障</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里的关键是<strong>缓存回执</strong>：设备对重复 <code>request_id</code> 必须返回第一次的执行结果（成功 / 卡锁 / 已超过脉冲窗口），而不是重新驱动电磁锁。这与 HTTP 语义一致——RFC 9110 规定 GET/PUT/DELETE 等方法是幂等的，而「开柜」本质上应被建模为一次 <code>PUT /lockers/{id}/compartments/{slot}/state {state: open}</code>，而非不可幂等的 <code>POST</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[IDLE] --&gt;|valid open_request| B[OPENING]&#10;    B --&gt;|门磁 opened| C[OPEN]&#10;    B --&gt;|脉冲超时无反馈| D[FAULT]&#10;    C --&gt;|门磁 closed + 取走| A&#10;    D --&gt;|人工复位| A\">graph LR\n    A[IDLE] --&gt;|valid open_request| B[OPENING]\n    B --&gt;|门磁 opened| C[OPEN]\n    B --&gt;|脉冲超时无反馈| D[FAULT]\n    C --&gt;|门磁 closed + 取走| A\n    D --&gt;|人工复位| A</pre><h2 id=\"鉴权与信任链-从设备身份到指令签名\">鉴权与信任链：从设备身份到指令签名</h2><p>柜机部署在无人值守的街边，攻击面包括伪造开柜、重放旧指令、以及中间人截获。信任链必须在<strong>设备上线时</strong>就建立，而不是等指令来了再校验。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层是设备身份。</strong> 每台柜机主控烧录唯一设备证书，走 <strong>TLS 1.3 双向认证（mTLS，RFC 8446）</strong> 接入 MQTT Broker。没有有效证书的连接在 TCP 握手阶段即被拒绝，指令面根本暴露不到未认证设备。设备证书的私钥存于主控的安全元件（SE / TPM）内，不可导出。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层是指令签名。</strong> mTLS 只证明「这是本机」，不证明「这条指令有没有被篡改、是不是旧的」。因此每条开柜指令携带服务端签名，推荐按 <strong>RFC 9421（HTTP Message Signatures，2024）</strong> 的思路对关键字段做规范化后签名，算法用 <strong>HMAC-SHA256（RFC 2104）</strong> 或 Ed25519。签名的覆盖范围必须包含<strong>全部决定物理后果的字段</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sig</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>MAC</mtext><mi>K</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>request_id</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>device_id</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>slot_id</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>issued_at</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>nonce</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sig} = \\text{MAC}_{K}\\big(\\text{request\\_id} \\,\\|\\, \\text{device\\_id} \\,\\|\\, \\text{slot\\_id} \\,\\|\\, \\text{issued\\_at} \\,\\|\\, \\text{nonce}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sig</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">request_id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">device_id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slot_id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">issued_at</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nonce</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要攻击者改动了 <code>slot_id</code>（把 3 号格口改成 8 号），签名立即失效。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层是时间窗与非重放。</strong> <code>issued_at</code> 加上最大容忍偏移（典型 ±60 s）构成时效窗，<code>nonce</code> 在窗口内单次有效，配合前述 <code>request_id</code> 去重表，构成纵深防御。IP 白名单、蜂窝专网 APN、以及基于 <strong>IEC 62443</strong>（工业自动化与控制系统网络安全标准）的区段划分，可作为弱网与物理防护的补充，但绝不能替代密码学鉴权。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防护层</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>抵御的攻击</th>\n<th>失效后的降级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>mTLS 1.3</td>\n<td>未认证设备接入、窃听</td>\n<td>拒绝连接，不入总线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息层</td>\n<td>指令签名 HMAC/Ed25519</td>\n<td>篡改、伪造格口</td>\n<td>拒绝执行并告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序层</td>\n<td>时间窗 + nonce</td>\n<td>重放旧指令</td>\n<td>丢弃并计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>request_id 去重 + 状态机</td>\n<td>重试导致的连开</td>\n<td>返回缓存回执</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常被忽略的鉴权盲点是<strong>运维面</strong>。维护工程师用的开柜工具必须与用户面走同一套签名与审计，禁止存在「万能开柜后门命令」。所有开柜（含运维）都要落审计日志：谁、何时、对哪台柜、哪个格口、依据什么授权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时延预算-从点击到门弹开的链路分解\">时延预算：从点击到门弹开的链路分解</h2><p>用户体验的硬指标是 App 点击后<strong>门在 3–5 s 内弹开</strong>，超过这个范围用户会重复点击，直接放大幂等压力。因此时延必须做预算分解，而不是笼统要求「快」。</p>\n<p>设端到端时延 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>e2e</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{e2e}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">e2e</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为各段之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>e2e</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>api</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>mq</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gw</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>bus</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>lock</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{e2e}} = T_{\\text{api}} + T_{\\text{mq}} + T_{\\text{gw}} + T_{\\text{bus}} + T_{\\text{lock}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">e2e</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">api</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mq</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bus</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>典型预算</th>\n<th>主导因素</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>api</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{api}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">api</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 业务 API</td>\n<td>100–300 ms</td>\n<td>鉴权、库存查询</td>\n<td>缓存格口状态，避免同步查库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>mq</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{mq}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mq</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 消息投递</td>\n<td>200–800 ms</td>\n<td>蜂窝 RTT、QoS</td>\n<td>QoS1 + 长连接保活，避免每指令重建连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gw</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{gw}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 主控处理</td>\n<td>50–150 ms</td>\n<td>轮询周期</td>\n<td>事件驱动代替定时轮询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>bus</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{bus}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bus</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 总线</td>\n<td>50–200 ms</td>\n<td>RS-485 波特率、从板数</td>\n<td>地址分片、提高轮询优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>lock</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{lock}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 锁动作</td>\n<td>200–600 ms</td>\n<td>电磁锁脉冲、机械行程</td>\n<td>合理保持时间，避免过长发热</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>蜂窝链路的 RTT 是最大不确定项。4G Cat.1 的空口往返通常 30–80 ms，但在弱信号区可达数百毫秒并伴随重传；<strong>NB-IoT</strong> 省电模式下上行时延更长（可达秒级），因此开柜指令面通常不用 NB-IoT，而把 NB-IoT 留给低频的门磁心跳上报。<strong>MQTT over TLS 的长连接保活</strong>（keepalive 典型 30–60 s）保证指令不必等待 TCP 重建，是压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>mq</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{mq}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mq</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[App 点击] --&gt; B[业务 API 鉴权+查格口状态]&#10;    B --&gt; C[MQTT Broker 投递 QoS1]&#10;    C --&gt; D{柜机在线?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[主控解析+验签]&#10;    E --&gt; F[RS-485 下发到锁控板]&#10;    F --&gt; G[电磁锁脉冲]&#10;    G --&gt; H[门磁反馈]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| I[进入离线队列&lt;br/&gt;上线补发]&#10;    H --&gt; J[回执上行+对账]\">graph TD\n    A[App 点击] --&gt; B[业务 API 鉴权+查格口状态]\n    B --&gt; C[MQTT Broker 投递 QoS1]\n    C --&gt; D{柜机在线?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[主控解析+验签]\n    E --&gt; F[RS-485 下发到锁控板]\n    F --&gt; G[电磁锁脉冲]\n    G --&gt; H[门磁反馈]\n    D --&gt;|否| I[进入离线队列&lt;br/&gt;上线补发]\n    H --&gt; J[回执上行+对账]</pre><h2 id=\"离线降级与断连对账\">离线降级与断连对账</h2><p>柜机掉线是常态而非异常：地下车库、弱信号、SIM 流量耗尽。协议设计必须回答「掉线时用户还能不能取件」。主流做法是给柜机主控保留一个<strong>短时可用的离线取件通道</strong>——用户在柜机屏幕输入取件码，主控在<strong>本地白名单</strong>内校验（码 + 有效期 + 单次使用），不依赖云端实时在线。本地校验的凭据由云端预先下发并签名，本质是把鉴权下沉到设备侧，代价是离线期间无法实时吊销，因此白名单 TTL 通常限制在 1–4 小时。</p>\n<p>断连恢复后的<strong>对账</strong>靠事件溯源：设备把每次开柜的 <code>request_id</code>、<code>slot_id</code>、<code>result</code>、<code>timestamp</code> 作为事件缓存并补发，云端以 <code>request_id</code> 为键做幂等归并，用状态机把「云端以为 OPENING」而「设备已 OPEN 且用户取走」的漂移收敛回一致。这一层保证即使回执丢失，业务侧最终也能判定包裹是否被取走，避免重复计费或错误超期退货。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>开柜是分布式事务</strong>，不是一条无状态 RPC；协议必须区分指令、执行、回执、确认四类事件。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等锚点是全局唯一 <code>request_id</code> + 去重窗口 + 格口状态机</strong>；重复请求返回缓存回执，绝不重复驱动锁。</li>\n<li><strong>鉴权是三层纵深</strong>：mTLS 设备身份（RFC 8446）、指令签名（RFC 9421 / HMAC RFC 2104）、时间窗与 nonce 防重放；运维开柜同样受审计约束。</li>\n<li><strong>时延要分解预算</strong>，3–5 s 的端到端目标里蜂窝 RTT 是最大变量；用 MQTT QoS1 长连接而非每条指令重建连接。</li>\n<li><strong>离线必须可降级</strong>，本地签名白名单让用户在断网时仍能取件，TTL 限制在小时级以平衡可用性与吊销能力。</li>\n<li><strong>断连靠事件溯源对账</strong>，以 <code>request_id</code> 归并补发事件，把云端与设备的状态漂移最终收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>硬件的格口与锁控板分层决定了上述总线时延与执行路径的边界，详见同 hub 的 <a href=\"locker-hardware-compartment-model\">柜机硬件架构与格口规格建模</a>；而网络中不同节点类型（无人柜机 vs 有人柜台）对开柜协议的要求差异，见 <a href=\"../pudo-network-model-placement/pudo-network-topology-node-taxonomy\">PUDO 末端网络拓扑与节点类型建模</a>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>说明：本文事实基于公开发布标准——CEN/TS 17400（CEN 邮政服务）、MQTT 5.0（OASIS）、TLS 1.3（RFC 8446）、HTTP Message Signatures（RFC 9421）、HMAC（RFC 2104）、IEC 62443、OCPP 2.0.1（Open Charge Alliance）。标称时延与去重窗口为工程经验区间，落地以目标柜机厂商锁控板规格书为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IoT 联通与开柜指令协议设计（幂等、鉴权、时延）","id":"iot-联通与开柜指令协议设计-幂等-鉴权-时延"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：开柜是一条有状态的指令通道","id":"核心概念-开柜是一条有状态的指令通道"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等设计：请求 ID、去重窗口与格口状态机","id":"幂等设计-请求-id-去重窗口与格口状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"鉴权与信任链：从设备身份到指令签名","id":"鉴权与信任链-从设备身份到指令签名"},{"level":2,"text":"时延预算：从点击到门弹开的链路分解","id":"时延预算-从点击到门弹开的链路分解"},{"level":2,"text":"离线降级与断连对账","id":"离线降级与断连对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"柜机硬件架构与格口规格建模（尺寸/温控/电池/可扩展）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-parcel-locker-pudo-network/locker-hardware-iot-integration/locker-hardware-compartment-model"},"next":{"title":"离线降级、固件 OTA 与远程故障诊断运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-parcel-locker-pudo-network/locker-hardware-iot-integration/offline-degradation-firmware-ota-ops"}}